      ],
      "source": "https://usapulse.blog/5-secrets-rappahannock-academy-va",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "During the Civil War, the academy became a contested battlefield, a refuge for wounded soldiers, and a witness to a famous manhunt.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://usapulse.blog/5-secrets-rappahannock-academy-va",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The academy’s brick ruins still stand near the Rappahannock River, a strategic waterway that saw many Civil War skirmishes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://usapulse.blog/5-secrets-rappahannock-academy-va",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The community of Rappahannock Academy takes its name from the former academy, which no longer operates.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
